---
import SectionWrapper from '../ui/SectionWrapper.astro';
---

<SectionWrapper>
  <section class="container content-section">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">PHILOSOPHY</p>
      <h2>Simple, useful, and learning-oriented systems</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="content-block">
      <p>E Deviser values clarity over hype, practical value over ornamental complexity, and learning over static certainty.</p>
      <p>We aim to build systems that help people understand, decide, and improve in context, especially where structure and knowledge are the real bottleneck.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</SectionWrapper>
